     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div><p style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Wildlife Disease Analyst (1 position)</b><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> </span>–<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> </span></span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline\">Student Contractor position (open to recent/soon to graduate PhD students)   </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 36pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;line-height:12.65pt\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 36pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;line-height:12.65pt\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">Duties will </span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">include research on ungulates in the western US.<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> </span></span>Specific duties will include working with managers to identify potential for multi-population study on chronic wasting disease (CWD), working with interdisciplinary team, managing datasets, conducting statistical analyses in the statistical software R, and preparing manuscripts for publication.<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> </span></span>Opportunity to lead research.<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> </span></span> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 36pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;line-height:12.65pt\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><br aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 36pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;line-height:12.65pt\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">Will be part of a team working on diverse aspects of CWD:  <a href=\"https://www.usgs.gov/centers/norock/science/chronic-wasting-disease?qt-science_center_objects=0#qt-science_center_objects\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.usgs.gov/centers/norock/science/chronic-wasting-disease?qt-science_center_objects%3D0%23qt-science_center_objects&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492019484000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1bgi8UjWbj6PjR8_kysKlq\">https://www.usgs.gov/centers/norock/science/chronic-wasting-disease?qt-science_center_objects=0#qt-science_center_objects</a></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 36pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;line-height:12.65pt\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 36pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;line-height:12.65pt\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">Strong statistical and coding background required.  </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 36pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;line-height:12.65pt\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">Background in disease ecology required. </span><br aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 36pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;line-height:12.65pt\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">Experience with analysis and manuscript preparation preferred.  </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 36pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;line-height:12.65pt\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 36pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;line-height:12.65pt\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">Experience in analysis of GPS collar data (RSFs, SSFs, UDs) preferred. </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 36pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;line-height:12.65pt\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">Strong communication skills preferred.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 36pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;line-height:12.65pt\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 36pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:15px;line-height:12.65pt\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:11pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">GS-11 equivalent.</span></font><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:11pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> </span></span><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:11pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">May begin as early as January 15.</span></font><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:11pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> </span></span><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:11pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">Must be current PhD student or have graduated within 10 months.  40 hours per week.<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> </span></span></font><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:11pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">  </span><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:11pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">Duty station: West Glacier, MT, with some remote work possible (must be in United States)</span></font></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;line-height:12.65pt\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"> </span></p><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:11pt;line-height:15.6933px;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:black\">Please send your resume and cover letter that highlights the required and relevant skills for the position, educational transcripts, and 3 references to </span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:11pt;line-height:15.6933px;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><a href rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\" data-email-masked><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">tgr...@usgs.gov</span></a>, who will supervise this position</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:11pt;line-height:15.6933px;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:black\">.  Application review will begin November 30th.  Seeking diverse applicants to be part of our inclusive team.<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> </span></span>Please send questions to Dr. Tabitha Graves at<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> </span></span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:11pt;line-height:15.6933px;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><a href rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\" data-email-masked><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:1pt none windowtext;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">tgr...@usgs.gov</span></a></span><br></div></div></div>\r\n"
